{"result":"{
  "id": "18825",
  "key": "SFCC-462",
  "summary": "US Tax Display — Exclusive Pricing & Checkout Calculation",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18825",
  "description": "**As a** Site Admin, \n**I want** to configure SFCC Business Manager to display prices excluding tax on US storefronts, \n**so that** US shoppers see pre-tax prices during browsing and the correct tax is applied at checkout.\n\nBoth US storefronts display prices exclusive of tax. The checkout tax handling differs per storefront:\n\n  - **US Domestic* — SFCC owns the checkout. Avalara calculates state-level tax and displays it as a separate \"TAX\" line item in the order summary.\n  - **US International* — Global-e owns the checkout. Tax and duties calculation at checkout is Global-e's responsibility and is out of scope for this story.\n\nCart-level tax line item display is covered in [SFCC-274](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274) .",
